--- notes ---
* VK_LAYER_KHRONOS_validation NOT installed on this system; smoke ran without validation layers.
* radv 'not a conformant implementation' warnings are driver banner noise, not errors.
* empirical finding: vkSignalSemaphoreKHR on BINARY semaphores returns VK_ERROR_DEVICE_LOST
  on BOTH RADV (GFX1201) and ANV (ARL), exportable or not -> host-signaling is timeline-only in practice.
  the -1 already-signaled sentinel is therefore implemented as an empty queue submit + DeviceWaitIdle.
* VkImportSemaphoreFdInfoKHR field order differs between vulkan header revisions (semaphore before flags
  on this box); designated initializers must follow the LOCAL header order.
